It is an independent implementation of the Diff Match and Patch algorithms.
Those algorithms, the accompanying API and the "Diff Match and Patch" name
originate from Google's library:

    Diff Match and Patch
    Copyright 2006 Google Inc.
    https://github.com/google/diff-match-patch
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The class layout takes inspiration from the PHP port by Daniil Skrobov
(https://github.com/yetanotherape/diff-match-patch); no code from it is
reproduced here.
